    "body": "Its forecast takes this form: probability, over to weekly expiry, graded at expiry close. It is graded on a score that rewards probabilities that land close to what actually happens. It would be ended if after 26 weekly expiries, its Brier is no better than the uncorrected IV POP's. It counts as proven at 26 weekly expiries.",
